WEBVTT

00:00:03.751 --> 00:00:06.650
You built the business. Would it run without you?

00:00:08.576 --> 00:00:16.064
Campaigns change direction. Policies change. New regulations land. And every question comes back to you.

00:00:17.151 --> 00:00:20.704
CriticalDash is the record of every decision, and who made the call.

00:00:22.151 --> 00:00:26.204
One source of truth. Everyone who needs to know, knows.

00:00:26.976 --> 00:00:30.273
Questions go to the right person, and they answer from their phone.

00:00:32.185 --> 00:00:35.335
Change it once, and everyone works from the new one.

00:00:37.185 --> 00:00:40.392
What's decided. What's open. Who's deciding.

00:00:42.218 --> 00:00:45.368
When everyone's aligned, you move forward with confidence.

00:00:47.218 --> 00:00:49.738
CriticalDash. By Incrementic.
